Statement of changes (required by the licence above)
-----------------------------------------------------

The software was changed by the maintainers of this fork. No change
below touches estimator logic, cut-offs, rounding, output formatting,
or the set of estimators that run. Nothing under cpp/shared/, cpp/iid/,
cpp/non_iid/, the *_main.cpp programs, bin/, or cpp/selftest/refdata/
has been modified from the upstream baseline.

2026-09-30  cpp/Makefile: on macOS (uname -s = Darwin) add Homebrew's
            include and library prefixes, and OpenSSL 3's keg-only
            prefix, to the compile and link lines (INC, LDFLAGS).
            Link rules now pass $(LDFLAGS); empty elsewhere.
2026-09-30  cpp/Makefile: on macOS compile with Apple clang and enable
            OpenMP via Homebrew's libomp (-Xpreprocessor -fopenmp,
            -lomp) instead of a bare -fopenmp, which Apple clang rejects.
            Non-Darwin command lines are unchanged.
2026-09-30  cpp/Makefile: on Apple-silicon macOS default ARCH to arm64
            so the x86-only -march=native flag is omitted, as upstream
            already does for any non-x86 ARCH. ARCH can still be set.
2026-09-30  cpp/selftest/pin-check.sh: new script that runs ea_non_iid
            on the upstream sample bin/ringOsc-nist.bin and asserts the
            reported min-entropy against upstream's own reference value.
2026-09-30  NOTICE (this file) and BUILDING.md added; one pointer line
            added to README.md. Build documentation only.

Only ea_non_iid is built and distributed from this fork. ea_conditioning
(the only program that links MPFR and GMP) is not built or shipped.


